he director  here holds on Adrien for an  uncomfortable amount of time as the  slightest smirk is held on Adrien almost  as if he's saying I've won but that  smirk is short-lived as several moments  later his throat is cut and he bleeds  out on the floor Cecelia having  retrieved the suit she hid in the closet  and using it to quickly grab Adrienne's  knife and slice his throat making it  look like he committed suicide this is  all knowingly captured on the security  camera which would prove it was a  suicide James comes rushing in hearing  the commotion and his stock by Cecelia  he sees the duffel bag with this suit  tucked in and agrees to let this all go  down as a suicide Cecilia the girl who  lived in fear and spent the first half  of the movie running away from Adrian  has become the opposite strong fearsome  and chases him down now some may argue  out there that maybe Adrien was innocent  and it was his brother all along but the  evidence against it is just too  overwhelming first we know Adrian is a  master manipulator insanely intelligent  and has the ability to get into people's  minds tom one-upping this master  manipulator just doesn't jive with what  we've been told about Adrian but more  importantly is what would be Tom's  motivation why would he take pictures of  Cecilia at night why would he haunt her  at every moment woman he barely knows  save for some awkward family parties the  more reasonable assessment is that  Adrian manipulated Tom just like he had  been doing his whole life how well we  simply don't know but let's also take  for example that if Adrian were innocent  then that throws into questions  Cecilia's murder of him casting the  ending in a far more grim light than it  already is  the Invisible Man is a great horror  thriller with plenty of twists and new  takes on an old classic that make it  seem fresh if Universal can take these  old monsters and creatures and create  new and interesting ways to tell those  stories there may be hope for the dark  universe yet I hope you enjoyed this  video please smash that like button and  subscribe  as I always have new content on the way  you can also follow me on Twitter at  things story whitey  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much

